<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Restoration Shaman Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Ulduar. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 2</h2>Restoration <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a> Tier 8 set has an excellent 4p bonus in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64922/item-shaman-t8-restoration-4p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Shaman T8 Restoration 4P Bonus</span></a>, which is equivalent to a huge (~8.7% or 400 to 450 rating) Haste increase for our main heal, and <b>acquiring <span class="c4">4 set</span> should always be your number one priority</b>, no matter the item level or slot of the Tier piece. You can safely break your Tier 7 set as soon as you get multiple Ulduar gear pieces.<br/>
<br/>While <b>Spell Haste</b> is the best stat for increasing your throughput and ability to reactively heal, stacking it does come at a cost to your Mana pool if you are spamming heals without pause. Gemming pure <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40017/quick-autumns-glow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick Autumn's Glow</span></a> is a strong throughput option but comes at a very high Mana cost when compared to using mostly <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39998/runed-scarlet-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Scarlet Ruby</span></a>, and thus would mostly be recommended for short fights or for Yellow sockets.<br/>
<br/>Below are two example sets of gear with full Mail and any armor type BiS without any profession assumptions, although <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> with its unique gear enchants and bombs is recommended.<br/>
